e of \nMaharashtra are at Annexure-I. \n   (b) The details of revenue collected through sale of entry tickets at Centrally \nProtected Monuments are at Annexure-II. \n   (c) The details are at Annexure-III. \n   (d) The monuments are conserved and maintained to attract more tourists thereby \ngenerating revenue. \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n\n                                                                                                                                             \nANNEXURE - I \n \nANNEXURE REFERRED TO IN REPLY TO PART (a) OF THE LOK SABHA \nUNSTARRED QUESTION NO.841 FOR 7.2.2022 \n \n     DETAILS OF CENTRALLY PROTECTED MONUMENTS AND SITES IN                  \nMAHARASTHRA \n \nSL. NO. NAME OF DISTRICT NUMBER OF \nMONUMENTS/SITES \n1. Ahmednagar 29 \n2. Akola 09 \n3. Amaravati  08 \n4. Aurangabad 10 \n5. Bhandara 10 \n6. Bheed 01 \n7. Buldhana 17 \n8. Chandrapur 21 \n9. Dhulia 11 \n10. Gadchiroli 09 \n11. Jalgaon 11 \n12. Jalna 01 \n13. Nagpur 13 \n14. Nanded 01 \n15. Nasik 11 \n16. Wardha 01 \n17 Yeotmal 06 \n18. Kolhapur 03 \n19. Mumbai 08 \n20. Raigad 50 \n21. Pune 20 \n22. Sangli 01 \n23. Ratnagiri 05 \n24. Satara 04 \n25. Sholapur 15 \n26. Sindhdurg 01 \n27. Thane 10 \n Total 286 \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n\n                                                                                                                                                     \nANNEXURE - II \n \n             ANNEXURE REFERRED TO IN REPLY TO PART (b) OF LOK SABHA \nUNSTARRED QUESTION NO.841 FOR 7.2.2022.  \n \n             DETAILS OF REVENUE COLLECTED FROM SALE OF ENTRY TECKETS \nAT CENTRALLY PROTECTED MONUMENTS IN MAHARASHTRA DURING \nLAST THREE YEARS. \n \n(amount in Rs.) \nMonuments/Sites Year- 2018-\n19 \nYear 2019-\n20 \nYear- 2020-21 \nAjanta caves 26194260 20639480 1882385 \nEllora Caves 63951030 62985955 6276240 \nTomb of Rabia Durani (Bibi ka \nMaqbara) \n29520015 30580970 4946610 \nDaulatabad Fort 12693085 14195471 2565790 \nPandulena Caves 52